WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,120
old man

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:05,230
Why is there no sound at all in this room?

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:08,500
I'm probably just waiting to be assigned a dormitory.

4
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:13,950
Do you know when we can be assigned a room?

5
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:18,370
We are all guinea pigs

6
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:21,420
No need for accommodation. What did you say?

7
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:25,220
There's no way this is a test subject, old man

8
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,220
Stop talking nonsense

9
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,340
This is the official base

10
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,700
We are rescued survivors

11
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:31,300
Not the guinea pig

12
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:37,360
You wish there are no survivors at all

13
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,240
Only raw dogs stay

14
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:41,160
So what if we argue?

15
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:44,800
It's better to let them wait a little later with hope.
